CinnabarIsland_PokemonLab_Lounge_Text_CliftonQuestAsk::
    .string "The lab studies how POKéMON grow.\pCatch 20 kinds of POKéMON and I\nwill give you a sample of our best\lgrowth candy.$"

CinnabarIsland_PokemonLab_Lounge_Text_CliftonQuestOk::
    .string "{STR_VAR_1} kinds already! Splendid!\pTake this RARE CANDY.$"

CinnabarIsland_PokemonLab_Lounge_Text_CliftonQuestGot::
    .string "{PLAYER} received a RARE CANDY!$"

CinnabarIsland_PokemonLab_Lounge_Text_CliftonQuestNo::
    .string "You've caught {STR_VAR_1} kinds.\nCome back at 20!$"

CinnabarIsland_PokemonLab_Lounge_Text_CliftonQuestDone::
    .string "Use the candy wisely.$"

CinnabarIsland_PokemonLab_Lounge_Text_QuestNoRoom::
    .string "Your BAG is full. Make some\nroom first!$"

CinnabarIsland_PokemonLab_Lounge_Text_NormaQuestAsk::
    .string "A POKéMON that trusts its TRAINER\nfully is a beautiful thing.\pLet me see your lead POKéMON.$"

CinnabarIsland_PokemonLab_Lounge_Text_NormaQuestOk::
    .string "It adores you with all its heart!\pPlease take this PP UP.$"

CinnabarIsland_PokemonLab_Lounge_Text_NormaQuestGot::
    .string "{PLAYER} received a PP UP!$"

CinnabarIsland_PokemonLab_Lounge_Text_NormaQuestNo::
    .string "It's fond of you, but not\nquite devoted yet.\pWalk with it, win battles together,\nand come back!$"

CinnabarIsland_PokemonLab_Lounge_Text_NormaQuestDone::
